    "id": "proswell_idm_chiptune_demo",
    "title": "Proswell-style IDM/Chiptune Sketch",
    "description": "A short IDM-meets-chiptune sketch in A minor. The DrumSequencer runs in **song mode** with four distinct sections (A=intro / B=verse / C=chorus / D=break-fill), each held for 4 bars before auto-advancing \u2014 a 16-bar arrangement. Chord pad cycles Am \u2014 F \u2014 C \u2014 G under a square sub bass; a Tracker channel carries the lead melody with pitch wobble (pb) and a pressure climax. Demonstrates the Phase 4 Tracker expression authoring + Phase 5 universal pressure/timbre wiring.",
