      "id": "intro_note",
      "text": "**Proswell-style IDM/chiptune** \u2014 A minor, 92 BPM.\n\n**Drums** (song mode, 4\u00d74-bar sections):\n  A = intro \u00b7 B = verse \u00b7 C = chorus \u00b7 D = break-fill\n**Chord pad**: ChordProgression Am-F-C-G into WavetableLayer.\n**Bass**: NotePattern walks roots into SubOsc square -1 oct.\n**Lead**: Tracker pattern with pb wobble + pressure swell into AnalogOsc Pulse.\n\nOpen the DrumSequencer editor \u2014 the section picker shows A/B/C/D.",
